{"_id":"68a736318ec3d8323af1cc4a","nodeId":"8mw4TxlLN4ZKAlLl-_NVV","roadmapSlug":"react","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:28.899Z","description":"# Functional Components\n\nFunctional components are some of the more common components that will come across while working in React. These are simply JavaScript functions. We can create a functional component to React by writing a JavaScript function. These functions may or may not receive data as parameters. In the functional Components, the return value is the JSX code to render to the DOM tree. Functional components can also have state which is managed using React hooks.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Functional Components and Props","url":"https://react.dev/reference/react/Component","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c19f"},{"type":"official","title":"Your first component","url":"https://react.dev/learn/your-first-component","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1a0"},{"type":"official","title":"Passing props to a component","url":"https://react.dev/learn/passing-props-to-a-component","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1a1"},{"type":"article","title":"Functional Components in React","url":"https://www.robinwieruch.de/react-function-component/","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1a2"},{"type":"video","title":"React JS Functional Components","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJ_qbsLf52w","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1a3"},{"type":"feed","title":"Explore top posts about React","url":"https://app.daily.dev/tags/react?ref=roadmapsh","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1a4"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:25:49.234Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163ae","title":"Scrimba - Advanced React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/advanced-react-c02h?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163fe","title":"Scrimba - Build a Movie Search App in React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/build-a-movie-search-app-in-react-c0u?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d041644e","